        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Wall of Fame\n- People: David Walliams, Jack Dee, Kate Garraway, Tamara Ecclestone, Sara Pascoe, Andrew Maxwell, Matt Lucas\n- Organizations: Sky1, BBC One\n- Topics: British comedy panel games, Little Britain\n\nFacts:\n- David Walliams was born as David Edward Williams on 20 August 1971.\n- David Walliams is an English comedian, actor, talent-show judge, author, presenter, and activist.\n- David Walliams is known professionally as David Walliams and is known for his partnership with Matt Lucas on the BBC One sketch show Little Britain.\n- Wall of Fame is a British comedy panel game that was first broadcast on Sky1 in 2011.\n- Wall of Fame is hosted by David Walliams.\n- Wall of Fame features Jack Dee, Kate Garraway, and Andrew Maxwell as regular panellists alongside two weekly guests.\n- Wall of Fame featured Tamara Ecclestone for the first two episodes, and Sara Pascoe took over from episode three.",
